entityDescription:
The main subject of the company's activity is:
- Construction, maintenance and management of information systems;
- Maintaining contact and exchanging information with private, municipal and state organizations;
- Maintenance of databases necessary for the work of state, municipal and private - individuals and legal entities;
- Provision of information to interested organizations;
- Development and commissioning of specific intelligent and information systems;
- Performing control functions regarding the quality of information;
- Organization and conduct of training and qualification courses;
- Consulting and information services;
- Services related to IT-business support - organization of trainings, meetings, conferences, etc.

